Dear Applicant,

Your application for the Inside Wireman Apprenticeship Program has been accepted for testing. You are scheduled to take the electrical industry aptitude test as follows:

TEST DATE:  Saturday, January 24, 2026
CHECK-IN:   8:30 AM sharp (doors close at 8:45 AM)
LOCATION:   Southland Electrical JATC Training Center
            2301 Industry Way, Fictionville, CA 92899 - Classroom 2

The test consists of two sections: algebra and functions (33 questions, 46 minutes) and reading comprehension (36 questions, 51 minutes). Bring a government-issued photo ID and two #2 pencils. Calculators, phones, and smart watches are not permitted in the testing room.

A minimum qualifying score is required to advance to the interview stage. Results will be mailed to you within two to three weeks.

If you are unable to attend, notify this office in writing by January 16, 2026. Applicants who fail to appear without notice will be removed from the applicant pool.

